    "content": "# 1.0 版本\n[1.2.2 Ver（251224）](https://colerith.github.io/electric-wave/#/post/59232f94-35ea-44ee-908a-d4a3cb99ef78)\n\n# 2.0 版本\n[2.0.0 Ver Beta（260106）](https://colerith.github.io/electric-wave/#/post/b9e9d956-473d-4ecf-93e3-8161a28a4726)\n[2.0.0 Ver 正式版（260117）](https://colerith.github.io/electric-wave/#/post/15472f12-56ca-4ea2-a23c-dd2881786a2e)",
